  "title": "Westport Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results",
  "summary": "2025 brought enhanced liquidity through completed Light Duty divestiture, the launch of GFI branded production in China and Canada, new HPDI™ OEM interest and global market traction for Cespira VANCOUVER, British Columbia, April 23, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Westport Fuel Systems Inc. (“Westport”) (TSX: WPRT / Nasdaq: WPRT) today reported financial results for the fourth quarter and year ended December 31, 2025, and provided an update on operations. All figures are in U.S. dollars unless otherwise",
